WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.950
Start from the list of who to call today, log the call and record a promise to pay.

2
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:13.850
Collections shows everything owed, and what to do about it today.

3
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:18.890
The totals: overdue, days to collect, promises due and broken promises.

4
00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:25.440
Who to call today ranks the tenants by how much and how long they owe.

5
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.610
Open a tenant.

6
00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:34.820
Their balance, the oldest unpaid invoice and the calls so far, on one page.

7
00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:38.760
Call the number shown, then log what happened.

8
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.580
They promised to pay.

9
00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:44.530
Enter how much, and by when.

10
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.190
Choose Log the call.

11
00:00:55.190 --> 00:01:03.420
The promise is tracked. If the date passes without payment, it comes back to the top of your list.
